      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so like, when we're talking about the 1948 part, is it more accurate to frame it as the establishment of a sovereign state after the UN partition plan, or is it more of an act of displacement for the people living there? i want to make sure i'm not biased in my intro.",
